---
description: Spontus design system guidance
alwaysApply: true
---

Design style:
- Clean, modern, athletic, and premium.
- Dark charcoal or navy base.
- Bright green accent unless the design system says otherwise.
- Generous spacing.
- Strong cards.
- Clear stats.
- One obvious primary action per screen.

The product should feel like a mix of Linear, Wellfound, Faire, and modern sports trading cards.

Use Tailwind and shadcn/ui components when possible after the app scaffold exists.

Avoid:
- Generic SaaS gradients.
- Dense enterprise dashboards.
- Fake-looking placeholder data.
- Overly complex onboarding.
- Making messaging/chat the center of the product.
- Designing for D1 athletics, NIL, or youth sports management.

Accessibility and responsiveness:
- Team officers may use the product on mobile after practice.
- Sponsor users are likely desktop-first.
- Use semantic buttons and labels.
- Keep forms readable and low-friction.
